  "prefLabel": "Bcr 103.01 Composition of Board",
  "priorExpiration": "2003-03-13",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bcr 103.01 Composition of Board.\n\n(a) Pursuant to RSA 155-A:10, I, the board consists of the commissioner and 15 members, appointed by the commissioner for a term specified by law.\n\n(b) The board shall elect a vice-chair at its annual meeting.\n\n(c) The chair shall preside over all meetings of the board.\n\n(d) In the absence of the chair at a meeting of the board, the vice chair shall preside.\n\nSource. #7760, INTERIM, eff 9-14-02, EXPIRED: 3-13-03\n\nNew. #8003, eff 12-12-03; ss by #10098, eff 3-12-12",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/bcr100.html"
